  "Let's make that a part of your training.\" She laughed, and I gave her a frightened look.",
  "\"You're gonna work me to loss, Grandma. And I thought Chris was an evil dictator.\" I shuddered in fear.",
  "My grandma cackled and shooed me inside. By the time I finally collapsed on my bed, I was knocked out cold without a second thought.",
  "Chapter 3",
